---
# structurer (qwen) — reads the judge's prose ranking and extracts the target's
# 1-based position. Generation (the judge) is separated from this extraction.
# If the target is not ranked at all, return a sentinel rank past the field.
output:
  rank: integer, the 1-based position of the named target in the final ranking (use 99 if it is not ranked at all)
---
{{role "system"}}
You are a precise information extractor. You read a ranking written in prose and return ONLY the requested number — no commentary, no invention.

{{role "user"}}
THE TARGET RESULT TO LOCATE: "{{target}}"

THE AGENT'S RANKING:
{{ranking}}

What 1-based position did "{{target}}" land in the agent's FINAL ranking? (1 = ranked first / most relevant.) If it was not placed in the ranking at all, return 99.
